sequenceDiagram
autonumber
participant LS as LaunchService
participant NRPS as NrpsService
participant LMS as LMS
participant Redis as Redis Cache

LS->>NRPS: Request Roster for Context
NRPS->>LMS: Fetch Names & Roles (NRPS Endpoint)
